<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Exposes single-precision floating point vector type with one component.</para>

<para>Include &lt;<link linkend="_vector__float1_8hpp">glm/ext/vector_float1.hpp</link>&gt; to use the features of this extension.</para>

<para><formalpara><title>See also</title>

<para><link linkend="_group__ext__vector__float1__precision">GLM_EXT_vector_float1_precision</link> extension. </para>

<para><link linkend="_group__ext__vector__double1">GLM_EXT_vector_double1</link> extension.</para>
</formalpara>
</para>
</section>
